
# basePath Chapter4

::FirstContractOpenCh4 
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 


// New optional research sample- Gold
{@PAL}		You have a call coming in Captain. Ready to get back to work?
//incoming call
{@Xavier}    Locke! Did you hear about the slowdowns at Kalvis? Copper prices are through the roof!
{@Xavier}    Terrible news for Kalvis. Golden opportunity for you.
{@Xavier}    Which is why I'm sending you a little sample, straight from the Planet of Gold and Golden Opportunities.
{@Player}    Blaze and the others are doing the best they can. It's not their fault Frontier's bots used cheap parts.
{@Player}	Frontier has a monopoly on the mining technology in this star system. 
{@Xavier}    Well, here in the <i>competently</i> managed, Frontier-supported Ralston system, our bots are humming along...


//end call

::BeforeSupplyChainCh4
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

//quinn will introduce the idea that the hauling region you need is . She wants you to connect to callie to make sure she's willing to deal with you since you are frontier now. 

//incoming call from quinn
{@Quinn}    I know someone who can beat those Frosch boron prices. By a lot.
{@Quinn}    But working with Callie can be a little... risky.
{@Quinn}	... so, try not to offend her.

//end call

//call callie

{@Callie}   A'hoy! 
{@Callie}   Be blessed in my presence mere corpo-lackey! Or as I like to call ye, Clackey!
{@Callie}  	It is I, the Boron Space Pirate Queen of Velos Station! 
{@Player}  	Nice to meet you... Callie. 
{@Callie}   ...all ships with Frontier bots are marked for pillaging!
{@Callie}   Holler if you need some goods, Clackey. 
//end call

